<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AUTOCOM WAY — Workbook Digital</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#141826;--surface:#1c2236;--surface-2:#222b42;--surface-3:#2a3450;--accent:#534AB7;--accent-bright:#6B61D4;--accent-glow:rgba(83,74,183,0.18);--accent-line:rgba(83,74,183,0.35);--text:#E8EBF4;--text-dim:#8A93B2;--text-muted:#4E5978;--border:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);--border-accent:rgba(83,74,183,0.4);--success:#2DD4A0;--radius:12px;--radius-sm:8px;--radius-lg:18px;--font:'Montserrat',sans-serif;--t:0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
body{font-family:var(--font);background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden;}
#progress-shell{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:200;height:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);}
#progress-bar{height:100%;width:0%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-bright),#8B7FFF);transition:width 0.5s ease;box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(83,74,183,0.7);}
.top-nav{position:fixed;top:3px;left:0;right:0;z-index:199;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 20px;height:54px;background:rgba(20,24,38,0.97);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
.nav-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.nav-logo{height:28px;width:auto;}
.nav-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:var(--text);text-transform:uppercase;}
.nav-sub{font-size:9px;color:var(--text-dim);}
.nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.save-badge{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:var(--success);background:rgba(45,212,160,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(45,212,160,0.2);padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;opacity:0;transition:opacity 0.4s;}
.save-badge.show{opacity:1;}
.nbtn{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);color:var(--text-dim);font-family:var(--font);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:var(--t);}
.nbtn:hover{border-color:var(--accent-line);color:var(--text);}
.nbtn.primary{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff;}
.nbtn.primary:hover{background:var(--accent-bright);}
.sidebar{position:fixed;top:57px;left:0;bottom:0;width:232px;background:rgba(28,34,54,0.97);border-right:1px solid var(--border);overflow-y:auto;z-index:100;padding:16px 0;}
.sidebar::-webkit-scrollbar{width:3px;}
.sidebar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--accent-line);border-radius:2px;}
.sp{padding:14px 18px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:6px;}
.sp-lbl{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:8px;}
.sp-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.pr-ring{position:relative;width:42px;height:42px;flex-shrink:0;}
.pr-ring svg{width:42px;height:42px;transform:rotate(-90deg);}
.r-bg{fill:none;stroke:var(--surface-3);stroke-width:3;}
.r-fill{fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:3;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-dasharray:113;stroke-dashoffset:113;transition:stroke-dashoffset 0.6s ease;}
.r-num{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);}
.pi .big{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text);line-height:1;}
.pi .sm{font-size:9px;color:var(--text-dim);margin-top:2px;}
.si{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:8px 18px;cursor:pointer;border-left:3px solid transparent;transition:var(--t);}
.si:hover{background:rgba(83,74,183,0.06);}
.si.active{background:rgba(83,74,183,0.12);border-left-color:var(--accent);}
.si.done .sin{background:var(--success);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--success);}
.sin{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--surface-3);border:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text-muted);flex-shrink:0;transition:var(--t);}
.si.active .sin{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent);}
.sit{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.2;}
.sis{font-size:9px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:1px;}
.si.active .sit{color:var(--accent-bright);}
.sic{font-size:10px;color:var(--success);margin-left:auto;opacity:0;}
.si.done .sic{opacity:1;}
.main{margin-left:232px;padding:72px 0 100px;}
.sp-panel{display:none;padding:36px 48px;max-width:840px;animation:fu 0.35s ease;}
.sp-panel.active{display:block;}
@keyframes fu{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}
.eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.etag{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-bright);background:rgba(83,74,183,0.12);border:1px solid var(--border-accent);padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;}
.emom{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-dim);padding-left:10px;border-left:1px solid var(--border);}
.stitle{font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:var(--text);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:6px;}
.stitle span{color:var(--accent-bright);}
.ssub{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:24px;max-width:560px;}
.sdiv{height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--border-accent),transparent);margin-bottom:24px;}
.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:22px 26px;margin-bottom:14px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color var(--t);}
.card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--accent),transparent);opacity:0;transition:opacity var(--t);}
.card:focus-within{border-color:var(--border-accent);}
.card:focus-within::before{opacity:1;}
.card.acc{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--surface) 0%,rgba(83,74,183,0.08) 100%);border-color:var(--border-accent);}
.card.acc::before{opacity:0.5;}
.ch{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:11px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.ci{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent-glow);border:1px solid var(--border-accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;}
.clbl{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:3px;}
.cq{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);line-height:1.5;}
textarea,input[type=text],input[type=date]{width:100%;background:rgba(20,24,38,0.6);border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--font);font-size:13px;font-weight:400;padding:11px 13px;resize:vertical;outline:none;line-height:1.6;transition:border-color var(--t),box-shadow var(--t),background var(--t);}
textarea:focus,input:focus{border-color:var(--accent);background:rgba(83,74,183,0.05);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(83,74,183,0.12);}
textarea::placeholder,input::placeholder{color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:400;}
textarea{min-height:88px;}
textarea.lg{min-height:116px;}
textarea.xl{min-height:150px;}
.rg{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}
.ro{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:11px 14px;background:var(--surface-2);border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer;transition:var(--t);user-select:none;}
.ro:hover{border-color:var(--accent-line);background:var(--surface-3);}
.ro.sel{border-color:var(--accent);background:rgba(83,74,183,0.1);}
.ro input{display:none;}
.rd{width:15px;height:15px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--text-muted);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;transition:var(--t);}
.ro.sel .rd{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent);}
.ro.sel .rd::after{content:'';width:6px;height:6px;background:#fff;border-radius:50%;}
.rt{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text);}
.tw{border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border);}
.dt{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;}
.dt th{background:var(--surface-3);padding:9px 12px;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-dim);text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
.dt td{padding:3px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);}
.dt tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
.dt td input{background:transparent;border:none;border-radius:5px;padding:8px 10px;width:100%;font-size:12px;color:var(--text);font-family:var(--font);outline:none;}
.dt td input:focus{background:rgba(83,74,183,0.08);}
.dt td input::placeholder{color:var(--text-muted);font-size:11px;}
.tadd{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--surface-2);border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-dim);transition:var(--t);}
.tadd:hover{color:var(--accent-bright);background:var(--accent-glow);}
.wg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;}
.wg .card{margin-bottom:0;}
.cg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px;}
.cf{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;}
.clb{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-dim);}
.co{display:none;margin-top:18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(83,74,183,0.15),rgba(83,74,183,0.05));border:1px solid var(--border-accent);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:26px;animation:fu 0.4s ease;}
.co.show{display:block;}
.cbadge{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;}
.crow-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;}
.crow{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;}
.cricon{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--accent-glow);border:1px solid var(--border-accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;flex-shrink:0;}
.crlbl{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-dim);letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1px;}
.crval{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);}
.csig{margin-top:18px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.csline{flex:1;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--border-accent),transparent);}
.cstext{font-size:9px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;}
#summary-panel{display:none;padding:36px 48px;max-width:840px;animation:fu 0.35s ease;}
#summary-panel.active{display:block;}
.sgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px;}
.sc{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:14px 18px;}
.sf{grid-column:span 2;}
.slbl{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:5px;}
.sval{font-size:12px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;}
.ea{font-style:italic;color:var(--text-muted);}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);font-family:var(--font);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.04em;cursor:pointer;border:none;transition:var(--t);}
.btn-p{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(83,74,183,0.3);}
.btn-p:hover{background:var(--accent-bright);transform:translateY(-1px);}
.btn-g{background:transparent;color:var(--text-dim);border:1.5px solid var(--border);}
.btn-g:hover{border-color:var(--accent-line);color:var(--text);}
.btn-s{background:var(--success);color:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(45,212,160,0.3);}
.btn-lg{padding:13px 28px;font-size:13px;}
.snav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:32px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);}
.snav-info{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:600;}
.toast{position:fixed;bottom:24px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(14px);background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--border-accent);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--font);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:9px 20px;border-radius:40px;z-index:1000;opacity:0;transition:all 0.3s ease;pointer-events:none;white-space:nowrap;}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);}
.mo{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:500;background:rgba(10,13,22,0.85);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
.mo.open{display:flex;}
.mb{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border-accent);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:30px 34px;max-width:410px;width:92%;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);animation:fu 0.2s ease;}
.mi{font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.mt{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:7px;}
.md{font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;}
.ma{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.mf{margin-bottom:12px;text-align:left;}
.mf label{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-bright);display:block;margin-bottom:4px;}
@media(max-width:860px){.sidebar{transform:translateX(-100%);}.sidebar.open{transform:translateX(0);}.main{margin-left:0;}.sp-panel,#summary-panel{padding:22px 16px;}.wg,.cg,.sgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.sf{grid-column:span 1;}.stitle{font-size:24px;}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

<div id="progress-shell"><div id="progress-bar"></div></div>

<nav class="top-nav">
  <div class="nav-brand">
    <img id="nav-logo-img" class="nav-logo" alt="AW">
    <div><div class="nav-title">AUTOCOM WAY</div><div class="nav-sub">Workbook Digital · Bootcamp</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="nav-right">
    <span class="save-badge" id="save-badge">✓ Guardado</span>
    <button class="nbtn" onclick="openPrint()">🖨️ Exportar PDF</button>
    <button class="nbtn primary" onclick="enviar()">📤 Guardar y enviar</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
  <div class="sp">
    <div class="sp-lbl">Tu progreso</div>
    <div class="sp-row">
      <div class="pr-ring">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><circle class="r-bg" cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/><circle class="r-fill" id="r-fill" cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/></svg>
        <div class="r-num" id="r-num">0%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pi"><div class="big" id="p-big">0%</div><div class="sm" id="p-sm">0 de 9 secciones</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav id="snav"></nav>
</aside>

<main class="main">

<!-- S1 -->
<div class="sp-panel" id="s1">
  <div class="eyebrow"><span class="etag">Sección 01</span><span class="emom">Al iniciar el Bootcamp</span></div>
  <h1 class="stitle">Mi punto de <span>partida</span></h1>
  <p class="ssub">Captura tu diagnóstico inicial. Estas respuestas serán tu referencia al final del programa.</p>
  <div class="sdiv"></div>
  <!-- AVISO IMPORTANTE -->
  <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(245,166,35,0.12),rgba(245,166,35,0.06));border:1.5px solid rgba(245,166,35,0.4);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:20px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;">
    <div style="font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">⚠️</div>
    <div>
      <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F5A623;margin-bottom:6px;">Antes de comenzar — lee esto</div>
      <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:#E8EBF4;line-height:1.7;">
        <strong style="color:#F5A623;">No cierres esta pestaña</strong> durante el Bootcamp. Trabaja siempre en el mismo dispositivo y navegador.<br><br>
        <strong style="color:#fff;">Importante:</strong> Al terminar <strong>cada sección</strong>, usa el botón <strong style="color:#F5A623;">📤 Guardar y enviar</strong> de la barra superior para guardar tu avance. Si refrescas la página sin haber enviado, perderás lo que escribiste en esa sección.<br>
        <span style="font-size:12px;color:#8A93B2;margin-top:6px;display:block;">💡 Recomendación: envía después de completar cada 2-3 secciones, no solo al final.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card acc"><div class="ch"><div class="ci">⚡</div><div><div class="clbl">Campo 1</div><div class="cq">¿Qué es lo que más me cuesta ejecutar consistentemente?</div></div></div><textarea id="s1_q1" class="lg" placeholder="Describe con honestidad qué actividad o proceso comercial se te dificulta sostener..."></textarea></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="ch"><div class="ci">📊</div><div><div class="clbl">Campo 2</div><div class="cq">¿Qué indicador me preocupa más?</div></div></div><textarea id="s1_q2" placeholder="Ej: tasa de cierre, volumen de prospectos, tiempo de respuesta..."></textarea></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="ch"><div class="ci">🎯</div><div><div class="clbl">Campo 3</div><div class="cq">¿Qué espero obtener de este Bootcamp?</div></div></div><textarea id="s1_q3" placeholder="¿Qué cambio concreto quieres ver en tu operación o resultados?"></textarea></div>
  <div class="snav"><div class="snav-info">Sección 1 de 9</div><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;"><button class="btn btn-g" onclick="enviar()" style="font-size:11px;padding:10px 16px;">📤 Guardar</button><button class="btn btn-p" onclick="goTo(2)">Continuar →</button></div></div>
</div>

<!-- S2 -->
<div class="sp-panel" id="s2">
  <div class="eyebrow"><span class="etag">Sección 02</span><span class="emom">Después de explicar SCP</span></div>
  <h1 class="stitle">Reflexión <span>SCP</span></h1>
  <p class="ssub">El Seguimiento Comercial Programado es la columna vertebral de la ejecución.</p>
  <div class="sdiv"></div>
  <div class="card acc"><div class="ch"><div class="ci">🔍</div><div><div class="clbl">Reflexión 1</div><div class="cq">¿Qué fuga de seguimiento detecté en mi operación?</div></div></div><textarea id="s2_q1" class="lg" placeholder="¿Dónde se pierden los prospectos por falta de seguimiento estructurado?"></textarea></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="ch"><div class="ci">⚡</div><div><div class="clbl">Reflexión 2</div><div class="cq">¿Qué práctica de SCP puedo implementar mañana?</div></div></div><textarea id="s2_q2" placeholder="Una acción específica, realizable en las próximas 24 horas..."></textarea></div>
  <div class="snav"><button class="btn btn-g" onclick="goTo(1)">← Anterior</button><div class="snav-info">Sección 2 de 9</div><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;"><button class="btn btn-g" onclick="enviar()" style="font-size:11px;padding:10px 16px;">📤 Guardar</button><button class="btn btn-p" onclick="goTo(3)">Continuar →</button></div></div>
</div>

<!-- S3 -->
<div class="sp-panel" id="s3">
  <div class="eyebrow"><span class="etag">Sección 03</span><span class="emom">Después de la dinámica</span></div>
  <h1 class="stitle">Detectives de <span>Incertidumbre</span></h1>
  <p class="ssub">Toda decisión de compra tiene incertidumbres ocultas. El asesor que las detecta primero, cierra más.</p>
  <div class="sdiv"></div>
  <div class="card acc"><div class="ch"><div class="ci">🕵️</div><div><div class="clbl">Hallazgo 1</div><div class="cq">¿Cuál fue la incertidumbre más difícil de identificar?</div></div></div><textarea id="s3_q1" class="lg" placeholder="¿Qué temor o duda del cliente no estabas detectando antes?"></textarea></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="ch"><div class="ci">💡</div><div><div class="clbl">Hallazgo 2</div><div class="cq">¿Qué aprendí sobre mis conversaciones comerciales?</div></div></div><textarea id="s3_q2" placeholder="¿Qué cambiarías en la forma en que conduces tus conversaciones?"></textarea></div>
  <div class="snav"><button class="btn btn-g" onclick="goTo(2)">← Anterior</button><div class="snav-info">Sección 3 de 9</div><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;"><button class="btn btn-g" onclick="enviar()" style="font-size:11px;padding:10px 16px;">📤 Guardar</button><button class="btn btn-p" onclick="goTo(4)">Continuar →</button></div></div>
</div>

<!-- S4 -->
<div class="sp-panel" id="s4">
